{"id":"word:hebrew:H530","type":"word","title":"אֱמוּנָה","subtitle":"H530 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"literally firmness ; figuratively security ; morally fidelity","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אֱמוּנָה (H530) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 49 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אֱמוּנָה (ʼĕmûwnâh) means literally firmness ; figuratively security ; morally fidelity First listed occurrence: 1Chr 9 22."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אֱמוּנָה","transliteration":"ʼĕmûwnâh","pronunciation":"em-oo-naw'","strong":"H530","lemmaId":"hebrew:H530","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["בֶּ/אֱמוּנָ֑ה","אֱ֝מֽוּנָתְ/ךָ֗","אֱמוּנָתְ/ךָ֣","אֱמוּנָ֑ה","וֶ֝/אֱמֽוּנָתְ/ךָ֗"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncfsa",13],["HNcfsa",9],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",8],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",2],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",2],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp2ms",2],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp2ms",2],["HC/Ncfsa",2],["HC/Td/Ncfsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"literally firmness ; figuratively security ; morally fidelity","usage":"faith(-ful, -ly, -ness, (man)), set office, stability, steady, truly, truth, verily.","full":"H530. emunah אֱמוּנָה noun feminine firmness, steadfastness, fidelity Exod 17:12 46t.; אֱמוּנוֺת Prov 28:20 . 1 literally firmness, steadiness: Exod 17:12 א יָדָיו ׳וַיְהִי his hands were steadiness (i.e. steady). 2. stead-fastness , עִתֶּיךָ אֱמוּנַת steadfastness of thy times Isa 33:6 . 3. faithfulness, trust: a. of human conduct Psa 37:3 ; Prov 12:22 ; Jer 5:3 ; 7:28 ; 9:2 ; 2Kin 12:16 ; in office 22:7 ; 2Chr 19:9 ; 31:12 ; 34:12 ; ( על ) בֶּאֱמוּנָה in trust (over) 1Chr 9:22 , 26 , 31 ; 2Chr 31:15 , 18 ; א ׳דֶּרֶח Psa 119:30 ; אֱמוּנוֺת אִישׁ man of great faithfulness Prov 28:20 ; associated with צֶדֶק in human character א ׳יָפִיחַ צֶדֶק יַגִּיד who breatheth out faithfulness sheweth forth righteousness 12:17 ; compare1 Sam 26:23 ; Isa 59:4 ; Jer 5:1 ; יִחְיֶה בֶּאֱמוּנָתוֺ צַדִּיק a righteous man by his faithfulness liveth Hab 2:4 (&gt; faith Luth AV RV). b. as a divine attribute Psa 88:12 ; 89:2 ; 89:3 ; 89:6 ; 89:9 ; Isa 25:1 ; Hosea 2:22 ; Lam 3:21 ; אֱמוּנָה אֵל Deut 32:4 ; his faithfulness is shewn in his works Psa 33:4 ; commands 119:86 ; in affliction 119:75 ; in his oath to David 89:50 . it reacheth unto the skies 36:6 ; unto all Generations 100:5 ; 119:90 ; he will not belie it 89:34 . It is אֹמֶן אֱמוּנָה Isa 25:1 ; compare מְאֹד אֱמוּנָה Psa 119:138 . It is closely associated with the divine חֶסֶד mercy 89:25 ; 92:3 ; 98:3 ; Hosea 2:22 ; with the divine צְדָקָה צדֶק, Psa 96:13 ; 143:1 ; Isa 11:5 ; & salvation Psa 40:11 .","rootNote":"or (shortened) אֱמֻנָה ; feminine of 529 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 9 22","keyReferences":["1Chr 9 22","1Chr 9 26","1Chr 9 31","1Sam 26 23","2Chr 19 9","2Chr 31 12","2Chr 31 15","2Chr 31 18"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":49,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 9 22","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֶּ/אֱמוּנָתָֽ/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 26","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֶ/אֱמוּנָ֞ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 31","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֶּ/אֱמוּנָ֕ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 26 23","book":"1Sam","chapter":26,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֱמֻנָת֑/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 19 9","book":"2Chr","chapter":19,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֶּ/אֱמוּנָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 31 12","book":"2Chr","chapter":31,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֶּ/אֱמוּנָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 31 15","book":"2Chr","cha